{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main8200_rival_01",
      "hash": "58016e7dc394c40f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：太好了……！\\c\\n来到这里的人是[VAR TRNAME(0000)]\\n真的是太好了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main8200_rival_02",
      "hash": "58016f7dc394c5c2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我战胜了四天王，\\n成为了宝可梦联盟的冠军！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main8200_rival_07",
      "hash": "58016c7dc394c0a9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你听到大木博士说的了吧？\\n成为冠军的人将来\\r\\n要在宝可梦联盟\\r\\n与更多的训练家对战！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main8200_rival_03",
      "hash": "5801707dc394c775",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "成为冠军后的第一个对手\\n是[VAR TRNAME(0000)]真是太好了……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main8200_rival_08",
      "hash": "5801757dc394cff4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "因为你正是我最想要\\n拿出我自己全部实力的对象！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main8200_rival_04",
      "hash": "5801697dc394bb90",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！\\n请接受我赌上冠军宝座的战斗！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main8200_rival_05",
      "hash": "58016a7dc394bd43",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：等你好久了，冠军！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main8200_rival_06",
      "hash": "58016b7dc394bef6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "为了能战胜[VAR TRNAME(0000)]你，\\n我天天都在锻炼自己！\\c\\n今天我可不会输！\\n接招吧！[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_rival_01_p01_cave_d1405",
      "hash": "671813dd36f0a3d6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 8]"
    }
  ],
